TradeLens

TradeLens is a fork of TraderMemos, originally developed by sinhong2011
and the TraderMemos contributors:
https://github.com/sinhong2011/TraderMemos

Fork source: https://github.com/HoesenBruce/TraderMemos-Private
Product name: TradeLens
Tagline: Record. Review. Improve.

The original project license, GNU Affero General Public License version 3,
is preserved in LICENSE. Existing copyright and attribution notices remain
applicable. The TradeLens name identifies downstream changes and does not
claim original authorship of TraderMemos or its third-party dependencies.

Repository names, CLI commands, API identifiers, database names, and the
preserved mobile client may still use TraderMemos for compatibility.
